#: src/index.md src/api.md
msgid "エンドポイント"
msgstr "Endpoint"

#: src/index.md
msgid "`POST /api/pages?project=&key=&kind=&role=&workspace=`"
msgstr "`POST /api/pages?project=&key=&kind=&role=&workspace=`"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"本文は HTML。番号を決めて `201` と JSON を返す。`n`・`created_at` は取り込み"
"の時だけ付け、番号が使われていれば `409`"
msgstr ""
"The body is HTML. Assigns a number and returns `201` with JSON. `n` and "
"`created_at` are given only on import; if the number is already in use, "
"returns `409`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "`GET /api/pages`"
msgstr "`GET /api/pages`"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"`project`・`key`・`kind`・`role`・`workspace`・`q`・`sort`・`limit`・"
"`before`・`after` で絞る。`{\"pages\":[…]}`"
msgstr ""
"Filter by `project`, `key`, `kind`, `role`, `workspace`, `q`, `sort`, "
"`limit`, `before`, and `after`. Returns `{\"pages\":[…]}`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "`DELETE /api/pages?project=[&key=][&kind=][&n=]`"
msgstr "`DELETE /api/pages?project=[&key=][&kind=][&n=]`"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"合うページを消し、番号を表 `removed` に残して、消した path の一覧を返す。`n` "
"には `key` と `kind` が要る。人は見分けない（だれが消してよいかは、呼ぶ側が決"
"める）"
msgstr ""
"Deletes the matching pages, keeps their numbers in the `removed` table, and "
"returns the list of deleted paths. `n` requires `key` and `kind`. It does "
"not tell people apart (the caller decides who may delete)"

#: src/index.md
msgid "`GET /<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html`"
msgstr "`GET /<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "本文。無ければ `404`、消したページは `410`"
msgstr "The body. `404` if it does not exist, `410` for a deleted page"

#: src/index.md src/api.md
msgid "`GET /`・`/<project>/`・`/<project>/<key>/`"
msgstr "`GET /`, `/<project>/`, `/<project>/<key>/`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "一覧の UI（絞った一覧）"
msgstr "List UI (filtered list)"

#: src/index.md src/api.md
msgid "`GET /api/events`"
msgstr "`GET /api/events`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "置かれるたびに 1 件を push（SSE）"
msgstr "Pushes one event each time a page is put (SSE)"

#: src/index.md src/api.md
msgid "`GET /api/backup`"
msgstr "`GET /api/backup`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "DB の写し"
msgstr "DB backup"

#: src/index.md src/api.md
msgid "`GET /api/version`"
msgstr "`GET /api/version`"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"サーバーの版と API の版（`{\"version\":\"0.2.0\",\"api\":1}`）。どの答えにも "
"header `Pagetray-Api` が付く"
msgstr ""
"Server version and API version (`{\"version\":\"0.2.0\",\"api\":1}`). Every "
"response carries the `Pagetray-Api` header"

#: src/index.md src/api.md
msgid "`GET /healthz`"
msgstr "`GET /healthz`"

#: src/index.md
msgid "生きているか"
msgstr "Whether it is alive"

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"**この Mac の中からだけ**: `Host` が `127.0.0.1`・`localhost` でない要求と、"
"`Origin` の付いた書く要求は断る。"
msgstr ""
"**Only from this Mac**: requests whose `Host` is not `127.0.0.1` or "
"`localhost`, and write requests that carry an `Origin`, are rejected."

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"**種類と役割の名**: 一覧は持たない。字の形（英小文字で始まり、英小文字・数"
"字・`-` で 32 字まで）だけを見る。"
msgstr ""
"**Kind and role names**: no list of names is kept. Only the form is checked "
"(starts with a lowercase letter; lowercase letters, digits, and `-`; up to "
"32 characters)."

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"**一覧の UI**: サーバーが HTML を組んで返す。絞り込み・並べ替え・検索は link "
"と form で、条件は URL に出る（script が無くても動く）。script がするのは、新"
"着の印・未読の印（browser が覚える）・時刻をこの Mac の時刻で出すことだけ。選"
"んだページは、右の枠（`sandbox` を付けた iframe）に 1 枚だけ出す。"
msgstr ""
"**List UI**: the server builds the HTML and returns it. Filtering, sorting, "
"and search use links and forms, and the conditions appear in the URL (it "
"works without script). The script only handles the new-arrival marks, the "
"unread marks (remembered by the browser), and showing times in this Mac's "
"time. The selected page is shown, one at a time, in the right-hand pane (an "
"iframe with `sandbox`)."

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"**番号**: 書く接続は 1 本で、1 つの SQL が「今の最大 ＋ 1」を取って足す。最大"
"は、置いてあるページ（`pages`）と消したページ（`removed`）の両方から取るの"
"で、消した番号は 2 度使わない（古い URL が別のページを指さない）。取り込みで"
"消した番号を名指すと `409`。置いたページを書き換えるエンドポイントは無い。"
msgstr ""
"**Numbers**: there is a single write connection, and one SQL statement takes "
"\"the current maximum + 1\" and inserts it. The maximum is taken from both "
"the stored pages (`pages`) and the deleted pages (`removed`), so a deleted "
"number is never used twice (an old URL never points to a different page). "
"Naming a deleted number on import returns `409`. There is no endpoint for "
"rewriting a stored page."

#: src/index.md
msgid ""
"**消す**: 1 つの取引で、`removed` に番号を写し、`pages_fts` と `pages` の行を"
"消す。本文は残さない（戻せない）。"
msgstr ""
"**Delete**: in a single transaction, copies the number into `removed` and "
"deletes the rows in `pages_fts` and `pages`. The body is not kept (it cannot "
"be restored)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"Apple Container（`container` CLI）で、release の image を動かす。`127.0.0.1` "
"だけで待ち受け、LAN にもインターネットにも開かない。"
msgstr ""
"Run the release image with Apple Container (the `container` CLI). It listens "
"only on `127.0.0.1` and is not open to the LAN or the internet."

#: src/run.md
msgid "物"
msgstr "Item"

#: src/run.md
msgid "値"
msgstr "Value"

#: src/run.md
msgid "image"
msgstr "image"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`ghcr.io/uraitakahito/pagetray:v<version>`（[release](https://github.com/"
"uraitakahito/pagetray/releases) に digest がある。arm64）"
msgstr ""
"`ghcr.io/uraitakahito/pagetray:v<version>` (the digest is in the [release]"
"(https://github.com/uraitakahito/pagetray/releases); arm64)"

#: src/run.md
msgid "container"
msgstr "container"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`pagetray`（`127.0.0.1:8801` と `127.0.0.1:8800` → 中の 8080。メモリは Apple "
"Container の下限の 200 MiB、CPU は 1）"
msgstr ""
"`pagetray` (`127.0.0.1:8801` and `127.0.0.1:8800` → 8080 inside. Memory is "
"200 MiB, the Apple Container minimum; CPU is 1)"

#: src/run.md
msgid "URL"
msgstr "URL"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`http://127.0.0.1:8801/`（一覧の UI。ページは `/<project>/<key>/<kind>-"
"<n>.html`）。`8800` は、前の置き場（Nginx。今は無い）の port。前に置いたペー"
"ジの URL を同じ path で開けるように、同じ container が待ち受ける"
msgstr ""
"`http://127.0.0.1:8801/` (the list UI. Pages are at `/<project>/<key>/<kind>-"
"<n>.html`). `8800` is the port of the previous page store (Nginx; now gone). "
"The same container listens on it so that URLs of pages stored earlier open "
"at the same path"

#: src/run.md
msgid "DB"
msgstr "DB"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"名前つきの volume `pagetray-data`（中の `/data/pages.db`）。Mac の folder は "
"mount しない"
msgstr ""
"The named volume `pagetray-data` (`/data/pages.db` inside). No Mac folder is "
"mounted"

#: src/run.md src/cli.md src/release.md
msgid "設定"
msgstr "Settings"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"環境変数 `PAGETRAY_DB`（既定 `/data/pages.db`）・`PAGETRAY_LISTEN`（既定 "
"`0.0.0.0:8080`）。image の既定のままでよい"
msgstr ""
"Environment variables `PAGETRAY_DB` (default `/data/pages.db`) and "
"`PAGETRAY_LISTEN` (default `0.0.0.0:8080`). The image defaults are fine as is"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"skills の `tpm` を使う Mac では、container と volume に触る命令を `tpm infra "
"run pagetray -- <命令>` で打つ（この repo の `.claude/roles/config.jsonc` "
"と、skills の設定が、環境 `pagetray` を「TPM に相談」の手続きで宣言してい"
"る）。下の命令は、その頭を省いて書いてある。使う版は、skills の `.pagetray-"
"version`（skills の cli と合わせてある版）。"
msgstr ""
"On a Mac that uses the skills `tpm`, run commands that touch the container "
"and the volume as `tpm infra run pagetray -- <command>` (this repo's "
"`.claude/roles/config.jsonc` and the skills settings declare the environment "
"`pagetray` with the \"consult the TPM\" procedure). The commands below are "
"written without that prefix. The version to use is the one in the skills "
"`.pagetray-version` (the version matched to the skills cli)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "起こす"
msgstr "Start"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"'\"digest\" *: *\"sha256:[0-9a-f]*\"'   # release の digest がこの中にある"
"か\n"
msgstr ""
"'\"digest\" *: *\"sha256:[0-9a-f]*\"'   # is the release digest in here?\n"

#: src/run.md
msgid "# 初めての時だけ\n"
msgstr "# first time only\n"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"digest の見方: `container image list` に出る digest は、Apple Container が付"
"ける別の値。release の digest は、`container image inspect` の `variants` の"
"中の `digest` に出る。"
msgstr ""
"How to read the digest: the digest shown by `container image list` is a "
"different value assigned by Apple Container. The release digest appears as "
"`digest` inside `variants` in `container image inspect`."

#: src/run.md
msgid "`-p` には必ず `127.0.0.1:` を書く。`-p 8801:8080` と書くと LAN に開く。"
msgstr ""
"Always write `127.0.0.1:` in `-p`. Writing `-p 8801:8080` opens it to the "
"LAN."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"8801 が使われていたら別の port にする。skills の担当が使う URL は、環境変数 "
"`TPM_PAGES_URL` で合わせる。"
msgstr ""
"If 8801 is in use, pick another port. Match the URL used by the skills "
"agents with the environment variable `TPM_PAGES_URL`."

#: src/run.md
msgid "起きる時に、まだ当てていない移行の SQL（`migrations/`）を DB に当てる。"
msgstr ""
"On start, it applies the migration SQL (`migrations/`) that has not yet been "
"applied to the DB."

#: src/run.md
msgid "確かめる"
msgstr "Verify"

#: src/run.md
msgid "`container list` で `pagetray` が `running`。"
msgstr "`container list` shows `pagetray` as `running`."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`lsof -nP -iTCP:8801 -iTCP:8800 -sTCP:LISTEN` が `127.0.0.1:8801` と "
"`127.0.0.1:8800` だけを出す（`*:` で始まる行があれば LAN に開いている）。"
msgstr ""
"`lsof -nP -iTCP:8801 -iTCP:8800 -sTCP:LISTEN` prints only `127.0.0.1:8801` "
"and `127.0.0.1:8800` (a line starting with `*:` means it is open to the LAN)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/healthz` と `curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8800/"
"healthz` が `ok` を返し、`curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/api/version` が、起こ"
"した版と `\"api\":1` を返す。browser で `http://127.0.0.1:8801/` が一覧を出"
"す。"
msgstr ""
"`curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/healthz` and `curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8800/"
"healthz` return `ok`, and `curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8801/api/version` "
"returns the version you started and `\"api\":1`. In a browser, `http://"
"127.0.0.1:8801/` shows the list."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`container logs pagetray` の頭に `pagetray <version> listen=0.0.0.0:8080 db=/"
"data/pages.db` が出ている。"
msgstr ""
"`pagetray <version> listen=0.0.0.0:8080 db=/data/pages.db` appears at the "
"top of `container logs pagetray`."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`container stats --no-stream pagetray` のメモリが数 MiB〜20 MiB ほど（初めて"
"起こした直後と、たくさん置いた直後は、OS が file を覚えている分で 50 MiB を超"
"えることがある。起こし直すと戻る）。"
msgstr ""
"Memory in `container stats --no-stream pagetray` is around a few MiB to 20 "
"MiB (right after the first start, and right after many pages are put, it can "
"exceed 50 MiB because of files the OS keeps cached. Restarting brings it "
"back down)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "DB の写しを取る"
msgstr "Back up the DB"

#: src/run.md
msgid "**版を上げる前と、volume に触る前**に取る。動かしたまま取れる。"
msgstr ""
"Take one **before upgrading and before touching the volume**. It can be "
"taken while the server is running."

#: src/run.md
msgid "'select count(*) from pages'    # 開けて、件数が合うか\n"
msgstr ""
"'select count(*) from pages'    # does it open, and does the count match?\n"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"写しには、置かれたページの本文がみな入っている。この repo にも CI にも置かな"
"い。"
msgstr ""
"The backup contains the bodies of all stored pages. Do not put it in this "
"repo or in CI."

#: src/run.md
msgid "写しから戻す"
msgstr "Restore from a backup"

#: src/run.md
msgid "volume を失った・DB が壊れた時。戻す間、ページは置けない。"
msgstr ""
"For when the volume is lost or the DB is corrupted. Pages cannot be put "
"while restoring."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"動かす image は空で `cp` も無いので、file を volume に入れる時だけ、shell の"
"ある image を借りる（上は `Containerfile` の build の段と同じ物。何でもよ"
"い）。"
msgstr ""
"The image you run is empty and has no `cp`, so borrow an image with a shell "
"only for putting the file into the volume (the one above is the same as the "
"build stage of the `Containerfile`; any will do)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"起こしたら「確かめる」をし、`curl -s 'http://127.0.0.1:8801/api/pages?"
"limit=1'` で一番新しいページを見る。"
msgstr ""
"After starting, do \"Verify\" and look at the newest page with `curl -s "
"'http://127.0.0.1:8801/api/pages?limit=1'`."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"写しが無ければ、空の volume で起こす。skills の `tpm page import` が、控えの "
"folder のページを同じ番号で入れ直す（置いた役割の記録は戻らない）。"
msgstr ""
"If there is no backup, start with an empty volume. The skills `tpm page "
"import` puts the pages in the local copy folder back under the same numbers "
"(the record of which role put them is not restored)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "止める・Mac を起こし直した後"
msgstr "Stopping, and after restarting the Mac"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"止めている間、ページは置けず、一覧の UI も開けない（番号をサーバーが決めるた"
"め）。止めるのは `container stop pagetray`。DB は volume に残る。"
msgstr ""
"While it is stopped, pages cannot be put and the list UI cannot be opened "
"(because the server assigns the numbers). To stop it, run `container stop "
"pagetray`. The DB remains in the volume."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"Mac を起こし直すと止まったままになる。`container system start` の後に "
"`container start pagetray` を打ち、「確かめる」をする。"
msgstr ""
"After the Mac is restarted, it stays stopped. Run `container system start`, "
"then `container start pagetray`, and do \"Verify\"."

#: src/run.md
msgid "volume（`pagetray-data`）は消さない。"
msgstr "Do not delete the volume (`pagetray-data`)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "版を上げる"
msgstr "Upgrading"

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"[CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/uraitakahito/pagetray/blob/main/"
"CHANGELOG.md) で、API の版が変わるか・移行の SQL が足されるかを見る（移行が足"
"された版は、当てた後に前の版へ戻せない）。"
msgstr ""
"Check [CHANGELOG.md](https://github.com/uraitakahito/pagetray/blob/main/"
"CHANGELOG.md) to see whether the API version changes and whether migration "
"SQL is added (a version that adds migrations cannot be rolled back to the "
"previous version once they are applied)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "新しい版の image を pull し、digest を release の値と見比べる。"
msgstr ""
"Pull the image of the new version and compare its digest with the value in "
"the release."

#: src/run.md
msgid "「DB の写しを取る」をする。"
msgstr "Do \"Back up the DB\"."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"`container stop pagetray`・`container delete pagetray` の後、新しい版で「起こ"
"す」の `container run` を打ち、「確かめる」をする（volume はそのまま付く）。"
msgstr ""
"After `container stop pagetray` and `container delete pagetray`, run the "
"`container run` from \"Start\" with the new version and do \"Verify\" (the "
"volume attaches as is)."

#: src/run.md
msgid ""
"駄目なら、`container delete pagetray` の後、前の版で `container run` を打つ"
"（移行が足されていなければ、同じ volume で起きる。足されていたら、3 の写しか"
"ら戻す）。"
msgstr ""
"If it fails, run `container delete pagetray` and then `container run` with "
"the previous version (if no migrations were added, it starts with the same "
"volume. If they were, restore from the backup taken in step 3)."

#: src/run.md
msgid "古い image は `container image delete` で消す。"
msgstr "Delete old images with `container image delete`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`pagetray` は、置き場を端末から操作する命令。置き場の [API](api.md) を HTTP "
"で呼ぶ。相手は、この Mac の中（`127.0.0.1`）の置き場だけで、認証も設定の "
"file も無い。"
msgstr ""
"`pagetray` is a command for operating the store from a terminal. It calls "
"the store's [API](api.md) over HTTP. It only talks to a store on this Mac "
"(`127.0.0.1`); there is no authentication and no configuration file."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "入れる"
msgstr "Installing"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"release に、macOS（arm64）用の binary が付いている。`gh` で取り、checksum を"
"確かめてから置く。"
msgstr ""
"Each release has a binary for macOS (arm64) attached. Download it with `gh`, "
"verify the checksum, and then put it in place."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "\"$(mktemp -d)\""
msgstr "\"$(mktemp -d)\""

#: src/cli.md
msgid "'pagetray-v<version>-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz*'"
msgstr "'pagetray-v<version>-aarch64-apple-darwin.tar.gz*'"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"browser で落とすと、macOS が開くのを止める（公証をしていない binary のた"
"め）。`gh` か `curl` で取る。"
msgstr ""
"If you download it with a browser, macOS refuses to open it (the binary is "
"not notarized). Download it with `gh` or `curl`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"Rust があれば、source からも入る: `cargo install --git https://github.com/"
"uraitakahito/pagetray --tag v<version> --locked pagetray-cli`。"
msgstr ""
"If you have Rust, you can also install from source: `cargo install --git "
"https://github.com/uraitakahito/pagetray --tag v<version> --locked pagetray-"
"cli`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "消す時は `rm ~/.local/bin/pagetray`。ほかに置く file は無い。"
msgstr ""
"To remove it, run `rm ~/.local/bin/pagetray`. It places no other files."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "命令"
msgstr "Commands"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "すること"
msgstr "What it does"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray status`"
msgstr "`pagetray status`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "置き場が生きているか、サーバーの版、API の版が合っているかを出す"
msgstr ""
"Shows whether the store is alive, the server version, and whether the API "
"version matches"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray page list`"
msgstr "`pagetray page list`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "ページを絞って探す（新しい順）"
msgstr "Finds pages with filters (newest first)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray page view <page>`"
msgstr "`pagetray page view <page>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "ページの本文を出す。`--web` で browser に、`-o <file>` で file に"
msgstr ""
"Prints the body of a page. `--web` opens it in a browser; `-o <file>` writes "
"it to a file"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray page put <file>`"
msgstr "`pagetray page put <file>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "ページを置く（`-` は stdin）。置いたページの URL を出す"
msgstr "Stores a page (`-` reads stdin). Prints the URL of the stored page"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray page delete <page>…`"
msgstr "`pagetray page delete <page>…`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "ページを消す（戻せない）"
msgstr "Deletes pages (cannot be undone)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray page watch`"
msgstr "`pagetray page watch`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "ページが置かれるたびに 1 行出す"
msgstr "Prints one line each time a page is stored"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray browse [<project>[/<key>]]`"
msgstr "`pagetray browse [<project>[/<key>]]`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "一覧の UI を browser で開く。`-n` は URL を出すだけ"
msgstr "Opens the list UI in a browser. `-n` only prints the URL"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray backup -o <file>`"
msgstr "`pagetray backup -o <file>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "DB の写し（SQLite の file 1 つ）を取る"
msgstr "Takes a copy of the DB (a single SQLite file)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray api <path>`"
msgstr "`pagetray api <path>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "API を直に呼ぶ。`-X <method>`・`-f <name>=<value>`・`--input <file>`"
msgstr ""
"Calls the API directly. `-X <method>`, `-f <name>=<value>`, `--input <file>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`pagetray completion <shell>`"
msgstr "`pagetray completion <shell>`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "shell の補完の script を出す（`bash`・`zsh`・`fish` など）"
msgstr "Prints a shell completion script (`bash`, `zsh`, `fish`, and others)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"旗の一覧は、どの命令も `--help` で出る。`<page>` は、ページの URL か、"
"`<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>` の形で書く。"
msgstr ""
"Every command lists its flags with `--help`. Write `<page>` as the URL of a "
"page, or in the form `<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "# 今いる folder の project の、Key が AI-22 のページ\n"
msgstr "# pages with the Key AI-22 in the project of the current folder\n"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "# 題と本文から探し、名指した欄だけを JSON で\n"
msgstr "# search titles and bodies, and print only the named fields as JSON\n"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "探す（`page list`）"
msgstr "Finding (`page list`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"絞る旗: `--project`・`--key`・`--kind`・`--role`・`--workspace`・`-q`（題と本"
"文の字）・`--before`・`--after`。`--oldest` で古い順、`-L` で件数（既定 "
"50）。"
msgstr ""
"Filter flags: `--project`, `--key`, `--kind`, `--role`, `--workspace`, `-q` "
"(text in the title and body), `--before`, `--after`. `--oldest` sorts oldest "
"first; `-L` sets the number of results (default 50)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`--project` が無ければ、どの project のページも出す。`--project .` は、今い"
"る folder の path から project の名を作る（英数字と `._-` のほかを `-` にす"
"る。skills の `tpm` と同じ作り方）。"
msgstr ""
"Without `--project`, pages of every project are listed. `--project .` builds "
"the project name from the path of the current folder (every character other "
"than alphanumerics and `._-` becomes `-`; the same way `tpm` in skills "
"builds it)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"端末には見出しの付いた表、pipe には tab 区切り（見出しは無い）で出す。`--"
"json` は、API の「ページの記録」に `url` を足した配列。`--json=key,url` のよ"
"うに欄を名指すと、その欄だけを出す。"
msgstr ""
"On a terminal the output is a table with a header; in a pipe it is tab-"
"separated (without a header). `--json` prints an array of the API's \"Page "
"record\" with `url` added. Naming fields, as in `--json=key,url`, prints "
"only those fields."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "置く（`page put`）"
msgstr "Storing (`page put`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`--project`（か環境変数 `PAGETRAY_PROJECT`）・`--key`・`--kind` が要る。"
"project を今いる folder から勝手に決めることは無い（置き間違いを防ぐため）。"
msgstr ""
"`--project` (or the environment variable `PAGETRAY_PROJECT`), `--key`, and "
"`--kind` are required. The project is never decided from the current folder "
"on its own (to prevent storing into the wrong place)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"番号は置き場が決める。同じ project・Key・種類に置き直すと次の番号になり、前の"
"版は残る。"
msgstr ""
"The store decides the number. Storing again to the same project, Key, and "
"kind gets the next number, and the previous version remains."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"置く人の役割は `--role`（か `PAGETRAY_ROLE`。既定は `human`）、居場所は `--"
"workspace`。"
msgstr ""
"The role of the person storing is `--role` (or `PAGETRAY_ROLE`; default "
"`human`), and their workspace is `--workspace`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "消す（`page delete`）"
msgstr "Deleting (`page delete`)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"戻せない。まず消すページを一覧で出し、**`--yes` を付けた時だけ**消す。`--"
"yes` が無ければ、何も消さずに終わる（終わりの code は 0）。"
msgstr ""
"It cannot be undone. It first lists the pages to delete and deletes them "
"**only when `--yes` is given**. Without `--yes`, it ends without deleting "
"anything (exit code 0)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"消す先は、命令に書いた物だけ: ページの名指し（いくつでも）か、`--project "
"<name> [--key <key> [--kind <kind>]]`。環境変数の project は、消す先にならな"
"い。"
msgstr ""
"The targets are only what is written on the command line: named pages (any "
"number), or `--project <name> [--key <key> [--kind <kind>]]`. A project in "
"the environment variable never becomes a target."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`-` で始まる project の名（`tpm` の project の名）は、URL で書くか、`--` の後"
"ろに書く: `pagetray page delete --yes -- -Users-me-x/AI-22/plan-1`。"
msgstr ""
"Write a project name that starts with `-` (the project names of `tpm`) as a "
"URL, or after `--`: `pagetray page delete --yes -- -Users-me-x/AI-22/plan-1`."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "消したページの URL は `410` を返し、同じ番号は 2 度使われない。"
msgstr ""
"The URL of a deleted page returns `410`, and the same number is never used "
"twice."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"**`PAGETRAY_NO_DELETE`**: この環境変数が付いていると（空と `0` のほか）、"
"`page delete` と `api` の `DELETE` は、何もせずに code 1 で止まる。置き場は、"
"だれが消してよいかを見ない。消してよい人を呼ぶ側が決める時に、これを使う"
"（skills の `tpm` は、担当を起こす時に付ける）。"
msgstr ""
"**`PAGETRAY_NO_DELETE`**: When this environment variable is set (to anything "
"other than empty or `0`), `page delete` and `DELETE` through `api` stop with "
"exit code 1 without doing anything. The store does not check who may delete. "
"Use this when the caller decides who may delete (`tpm` in skills sets it "
"when it starts a role)."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "旗が環境変数より先、環境変数が既定より先。"
msgstr ""
"Flags take precedence over environment variables, and environment variables "
"over defaults."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "旗"
msgstr "Flag"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "環境変数"
msgstr "Environment variable"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "既定"
msgstr "Default"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`--url`"
msgstr "`--url`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`PAGETRAY_URL`"
msgstr "`PAGETRAY_URL`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`http://127.0.0.1:8801`"
msgstr "`http://127.0.0.1:8801`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "置き場の URL（`http://` だけ）"
msgstr "URL of the store (`http://` only)"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`--project`"
msgstr "`--project`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`PAGETRAY_PROJECT`"
msgstr "`PAGETRAY_PROJECT`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "無し"
msgstr "none"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`page list` と `page put` の project"
msgstr "Project for `page list` and `page put`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`--role`"
msgstr "`--role`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`PAGETRAY_ROLE`"
msgstr "`PAGETRAY_ROLE`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`human`"
msgstr "`human`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`page put` で置く人の役割"
msgstr "Role of the person storing with `page put`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "—"
msgstr "—"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`PAGETRAY_NO_DELETE`"
msgstr "`PAGETRAY_NO_DELETE`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "付いていれば、消す命令を止める"
msgstr "When set, stops the deleting commands"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`BROWSER`"
msgstr "`BROWSER`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "macOS の `open`"
msgstr "`open` on macOS"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "browser を開く命令"
msgstr "Command that opens the browser"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "環境変数の proxy（`HTTP_PROXY` など）は使わない。"
msgstr "Proxy environment variables (such as `HTTP_PROXY`) are not used."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "終わりの code と、API の版"
msgstr "Exit codes and the API version"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "code"
msgstr "code"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "訳"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`0`"
msgstr "`0`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "できた"
msgstr "Success"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`1`"
msgstr "`1`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"置き場が断った（`4xx`・`5xx`。無いページ `404`・消したページ `410` を含む）。"
"file に書けない時も"
msgstr ""
"The store refused (`4xx`, `5xx`; including `404` for a missing page and "
"`410` for a deleted page). Also when a file cannot be written"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`2`"
msgstr "`2`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "使い方の誤り"
msgstr "Usage error"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`3`"
msgstr "`3`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "置き場が応えない"
msgstr "The store does not respond"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`4`"
msgstr "`4`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "API の版が合わない"
msgstr "The API version does not match"

#: src/cli.md
msgid "誤りの訳は stderr に 1 行で出る。stdout には、頼んだ物だけが出る。"
msgstr ""
"The reason for an error is printed on stderr in one line. Only what you "
"asked for goes to stdout."

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"`pagetray` は、置き場のどの答えでも header `Pagetray-Api`（[API の版](api.md#"
"版)）を見る。自分の話せる版と違えば、答えを使わずに code 4 で止まる。"
"`pagetray status` が、サーバーの版と API の版を出す。その時は、`pagetray` か"
"置き場のどちらかを上げて、版を合わせる。"
msgstr ""
"`pagetray` checks the `Pagetray-Api` header ([API version](api.md#versions)) "
"on every answer from the store. If it differs from the version it speaks, it "
"stops with exit code 4 without using the answer. `pagetray status` prints "
"the server version and the API version. In that case, upgrade either "
"`pagetray` or the store so that the versions match."

#: src/cli.md
msgid "`tpm page` との関わり"
msgstr "Relation to `tpm page`"

#: src/cli.md
msgid ""
"skills の `tpm` を使う project では、担当は `tpm page`（put・path・list・"
"delete）を使う。`tpm page` は、project・Key・役割・控えの folder・消してよい"
"人という `tpm` の決まりを持ち、同じ API を呼ぶ。`pagetray` は、その決まりを持"
"たない道具で、`tpm` を通さない場面（人の手元・`tpm` の project でない "
"folder）で使う。どちらで置いたページも、同じ置き場に入り、どちらからも探せ"
"る。"
msgstr ""
"In a project that uses `tpm` from skills, roles use `tpm page` (put, path, "
"list, delete). `tpm page` carries the rules of `tpm` (project, Key, role, "
"the local copy folder, and who may delete) and calls the same API. "
"`pagetray` is a tool without those rules, used where `tpm` is not involved "
"(at a person's terminal, or in a folder that is not a `tpm` project). Pages "
"stored with either one go into the same store and can be found from both."

#: src/api.md
msgid "API の仕様（API の版 1）"
msgstr "API specification (API version 1)"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"pagetray を呼ぶ側（skills の `tpm page` など）が頼ってよい形を書く。ここに書"
"いた形を、前からある呼ぶ側が困るように変える時は、API の版を上げる。"
msgstr ""
"This chapter describes the shapes that callers of pagetray (such as `tpm "
"page` in skills) may rely on. Whenever a shape described here is changed in "
"a way that breaks existing callers, the API version is bumped."

#: src/api.md
msgid "版"
msgstr "Versions"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"`GET /api/version` が `{\"version\":\"0.2.0\",\"api\":1}` を返す。`version` "
"はサーバーの版（`Cargo.toml`）、`api` は API の版。"
msgstr ""
"`GET /api/version` returns `{\"version\":\"0.2.0\",\"api\":1}`. `version` is "
"the server version (`Cargo.toml`); `api` is the API version."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"どの答えにも（誤りにも、断った答えにも）header `Pagetray-Api: 1` が付く。呼ぶ"
"側は、頼んだその答えで、API の版が合っているかを見られる。"
msgstr ""
"Every response (including errors and refused requests) carries the header "
"`Pagetray-Api: 1`. Callers can check whether the API version matches from "
"the very response they asked for."

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"この header が無い答えは、API の版ができる前のサーバー（pagestore 0.1.0）の"
"物。形は API の版 1 と同じ。"
msgstr ""
"A response without this header comes from a server that predates the API "
"version (pagestore 0.1.0). Its shapes are the same as API version 1."

#: src/api.md
msgid "API の版を上げる時・上げない時"
msgstr "When to bump the API version, and when not to"

#: src/api.md
msgid "変更"
msgstr "Change"

#: src/api.md
msgid "API の版"
msgstr "API version"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"エンドポイント・引数・答えの欄を**足す**（前からある呼ぶ側は、知らない欄を読"
"み飛ばす）"
msgstr ""
"**Add** an endpoint, parameter, or response field (existing callers skip "
"fields they do not know)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "上げない"
msgstr "No bump"

#: src/api.md
msgid "エンドポイント・引数・答えの欄を消す、名や型を変える"
msgstr ""
"Remove an endpoint, parameter, or response field, or change its name or type"

#: src/api.md
msgid "上げる"
msgstr "Bump"

#: src/api.md
msgid "code の意味を変える（`409` が別の訳で返る、など）"
msgstr ""
"Change the meaning of a code (e.g. `409` is returned for a different reason)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "URL の形（`/<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html`）を変える"
msgstr "Change the URL shape (`/<project>/<key>/<kind>-<n>.html`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "上げる（置いたページの URL が切れるので、まずしない）"
msgstr ""
"Bump (this breaks the URLs of pages already put, so it is practically never "
"done)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "引数の字の決まりを厳しくする（前は通った字が通らなくなる）"
msgstr ""
"Tighten the character rules for a parameter (characters that used to be "
"accepted are rejected)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "一覧の UI の見た目・文・HTML の作り"
msgstr "Appearance, wording, and HTML structure of the list UI"

#: src/api.md
msgid "上げない（UI は仕様に入らない）"
msgstr "No bump (the UI is not covered by the specification)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "誤りの文（`error` の中身）"
msgstr "Error message text (the contents of `error`)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "上げない（人が読む文。呼ぶ側は code で見分ける）"
msgstr "No bump (the text is for humans; callers tell errors apart by code)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "呼ぶ側は、知らない欄を読み飛ばし、`error` の文で分けないこと。"
msgstr ""
"Callers must skip fields they do not know and must not branch on the text of "
"`error`."

#: src/api.md
msgid "共通"
msgstr "Common rules"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"受けるのは、この Mac の中からの要求だけ。`Host` が `127.0.0.1`・`localhost`"
"（port は何でもよい）でなければ `403`。`GET`・`HEAD` のほかの要求に `Origin` "
"が付いていれば `403`（browser の中のページからは書けない）。"
msgstr ""
"Only requests from this Mac are accepted. If `Host` is not `127.0.0.1` or "
"`localhost` (any port), the response is `403`. If a request other than `GET` "
"or `HEAD` carries `Origin`, the response is `403` (a page inside a browser "
"cannot write)."

#: src/api.md
msgid "誤りの答えは `{\"error\":\"<人が読む文>\"}`。"
msgstr "An error response is `{\"error\":\"<human-readable message>\"}`."

#: src/api.md
msgid "字の決まり:"
msgstr "Character rules:"

#: src/api.md
msgid "引数"
msgstr "Parameter"

#: src/api.md src/release.md
msgid "決まり"
msgstr "Rule"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`project`・`key`"
msgstr "`project`, `key`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"英数字と `.` `_` `-` で 1〜255 字。`.` と `..` は駄目。`project` に `api` は"
"使えない"
msgstr ""
"1–255 characters of alphanumerics and `.` `_` `-`. `.` and `..` are not "
"allowed. `api` cannot be used as a `project`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`kind`・`role`"
msgstr "`kind`, `role`"

#: src/api.md
msgid ""
"英小文字で始まり、英小文字・数字・`-` で 1〜32 字。名の一覧はサーバーが持たな"
"い（呼ぶ側が決める）"
msgstr ""
"1–32 characters of lowercase letters, digits, and `-`, starting with a "
"lowercase letter. The server keeps no list of names (callers decide)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "`workspace`"
msgstr "`workspace`"

#: src/api.md
msgid "英数字と `:` `.` `_` `-` で 0〜64 字"
