msgstr "Backup of the DB (a single SQLite file)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "入る（file の中の表の形は入らない）"
msgstr "Covered (the table layout inside the file is not covered)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "置かれるたびに 1 件を push（SSE。中身はページの記録）"
msgstr ""
"Pushes one event each time a page is put (SSE; the contents are the page "
"record)"

#: src/api.md
msgid "一覧の UI"
msgstr "List UI"

#: src/api.md
