"（`v*`）を打った時に、workflow（`.github/workflows/docs.yml`）が GitHub "
"Pages に出す。PR と main への push では、build できるかと、英語の訳が原文と"
"合っているかを見る（job の名は `docs`）。"
msgstr ""
"This book is built with [mdBook](https://rust-lang.github.io/mdBook/), and "
"the workflow (`.github/workflows/docs.yml`) publishes it to GitHub Pages "
"when a release tag (`v*`) is pushed. On PRs and pushes to main, it only "
"checks that the book builds and that the English translation matches the "
"source text (the job is named `docs`)."

